{
  "$comment": [
    "Configuracion compartida de Claude Code para AguaVigia CTG. SI se versiona.",
    "Los permisos de 'allow' evitan que el agente pida confirmacion en operaciones",
    "de solo lectura o inofensivas. Todo lo destructivo queda fuera a proposito."
  ],

  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read(**)",
      "Glob(**)",
      "Grep(**)",

      "Bash(git status)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git branch)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",

      "Bash(./mvnw test:*)",
      "Bash(./mvnw verify:*)",
      "Bash(./mvnw compile:*)",

      "Bash(npm run test:*)",
      "Bash(npm run lint:*)",
      "Bash(npm run build:*)",

      "Bash(docker compose ps)",
      "Bash(docker compose logs:*)",

      "WebFetch(domain:acuacar.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:www.acuacar.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:news.google.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:zonacero.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:platform.claude.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:docs.spring.io)"
    ],

    "deny": [
      "Read(./.env)",
      "Read(./.env.*)",
      "Read(**/credentials.json)",
      "Read(**/*secret*)",

      "Bash(git push:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard:*)",
      "Bash(git clean:*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf:*)",
      "Bash(docker compose down -v:*)",

      "WebFetch(domain:eluniversal.com.co)",
      "WebFetch(domain:www.eluniversal.com.co)",
      "WebFetch(domain:eltiempo.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:www.eltiempo.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:elheraldo.co)",
      "WebFetch(domain:www.elheraldo.co)",
      "WebFetch(domain:bluradio.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:www.bluradio.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:facebook.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:instagram.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:x.com)",
      "WebFetch(domain:twitter.com)"
    ]
  },

  "$comment_deny": [
    "Los dominios de medios en 'deny' NO son un capricho: esos sitios bloquean",
    "explicitamente a anthropic-ai / Claude-Web / GPTBot en su robots.txt.",
    "Bloquearlos aqui hace que la regla etica del proyecto sea imposible de violar",
    "por accidente, en vez de depender de que alguien la recuerde.",
    "Ver docs/ingenieria/auditoria-fuentes-de-datos.md"
  ]
}
